{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cli_system_root","type":"text","x":400,"y":0,"width":400,"height":100,"text":"# Gemini CLI 命令系统\n\n三大命令体系完整架构","color":"5"},
		{"id":"slash_commands_group","type":"group","x":0,"y":150,"width":350,"height":650,"label":"🔵 斜杠命令（/）","color":"5"},
		{"id":"at_commands_group","type":"group","x":400,"y":150,"width":350,"height":650,"label":"🟠 At 命令（@）","color":"2"},
		{"id":"shell_commands_group","type":"group","x":800,"y":150,"width":350,"height":650,"label":"🔴 Shell 命令（!）","color":"1"},
		{"id":"slash_session","type":"text","x":20,"y":180,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 会话管理\n\n- `/chat save <tag>` 保存\n- `/chat resume <tag>` 恢复\n- `/resume` 浏览\n- `/clear` 清屏"},
		{"id":"slash_tools","type":"text","x":20,"y":310,"width":310,"height":120,"text":"### 工具管理\n\n- `/mcp list` 列表\n- `/mcp auth` 认证\n- `/tools` 显示\n- `/extensions` 扩展"},
		{"id":"slash_files","type":"text","x":20,"y":460,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 文件管理\n\n- `/directory add` 添加目录\n- `/restore` 恢复文件\n- `/copy` 复制输出"},
		{"id":"slash_settings","type":"text","x":20,"y":590,"width":310,"height":130,"text":"### 设置配置\n\n- `/settings` 设置\n- `/theme` 主题\n- `/vim` Vim 模式\n- `/memory` AI 记忆"},
		{"id":"at_basic","type":"text","x":420,"y":180,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 基本语法\n\n```\n@<path>\n@file.txt 问题\n@src/ 分析代码\n```"},
		{"id":"at_features","type":"text","x":420,"y":310,"width":310,"height":120,"text":"### 主要特性\n\n✓ 文件/目录注入\n✓ Git 感知过滤\n✓ 自动排除\n✓ 递归读取"},
		{"id":"at_exclude","type":"text","x":420,"y":460,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 排除规则\n\n- node_modules/\n- .env\n- .git/\n- .gitignore"},
		{"id":"at_use_case","type":"text","x":420,"y":590,"width":310,"height":130,"text":"### 使用场景\n\n代码审查、项目分析\n文档总结、代码生成"},
		{"id":"shell_single","type":"text","x":820,"y":180,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 执行命令\n\n```\n!ls -la\n!git status\n!npm run build\n```"},
		{"id":"shell_mode","type":"text","x":820,"y":310,"width":310,"height":120,"text":"### Shell 模式\n\n- `!` 切换进入\n- 连续执行命令\n- 特殊颜色标记\n- 按 Ctrl+D 退出"},
		{"id":"shell_platform","type":"text","x":820,"y":460,"width":310,"height":100,"text":"### 跨平台支持\n\n- 🐧 Linux: bash\n- 🍎 macOS: bash\n- 🪟 Windows: PowerShell"},
		{"id":"shell_env","type":"text","x":820,"y":590,"width":310,"height":130,"text":"### 环境变量\n\n`GEMINI_CLI=1` 被设置\n脚本可检测是否在 CLI 中"},
		{"id":"keyboard_shortcuts","type":"text","x":50,"y":850,"width":500,"height":150,"text":"# ⌨️ 键盘快捷键\n\n- **Ctrl+Z** - 撤销\n- **Ctrl+Shift+Z** - 重做\n- **Ctrl+L** - 清除屏幕\n- **Vim 模式** - `/vim` 启用","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vim_normal","type":"text","x":600,"y":850,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"### NORMAL 模式\n\n- h/j/k/l 导航\n- w/b/e 词跳\n- 0/$ 行端\n- dd 删除行\n- . 重复操作"},
		{"id":"vim_insert","type":"text","x":920,"y":850,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"### INSERT 模式\n\n- i 前插入\n- a 后插入\n- o/O 上下新行\n- Esc 返回 NORMAL\n- c/x 改变/删除"},
		{"id":"use_case_1","type":"text","x":0,"y":1050,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"## 场景 1️⃣\n### 对话保存\n\n```\n/chat save work\n... 继续工作 ...\n/chat resume work\n```"},
		{"id":"use_case_2","type":"text","x":320,"y":1050,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"## 场景 2️⃣\n### 代码分析\n\n```\n@src/ 分析代码\n\n/copy 复制结果\n```"},
		{"id":"use_case_3","type":"text","x":640,"y":1050,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"## 场景 3️⃣\n### Vim 编辑\n\n```\n/vim 启用\ni 输入内容\nEsc dd 编辑\n```"},
		{"id":"use_case_4","type":"text","x":960,"y":1050,"width":280,"height":150,"text":"## 场景 4️⃣\n### MCP 配置\n\n```\n/mcp list\n/mcp auth server\n/mcp refresh\n```"},
		{"id":"config_files","type":"text","x":0,"y":1250,"width":500,"height":180,"text":"# 📁 配置文件位置\n\n**Linux/macOS:**\n`~/.gemini/tmp/<project_hash>/`\n`~/.gemini/settings.json`\n\n**Windows:**\n`C:\\Users\\<You>\\...`"},
		{"id":"config_details","type":"text","x":540,"y":1250,"width":700,"height":180,"text":"## 主要配置\n\n- `.gemini/settings.json` - 全局设置\n- `GEMINI.md` - AI 分层记忆（项目级别）\n- `~/.gemini/settings.json` - Vim 模式偏好\n- `.gemini/tmp/<hash>/` - 对话检查点"},
		{"id":"comparison_table","type":"text","x":50,"y":1490,"width":1100,"height":220,"text":"# 📊 命令系统对比\n\n| 特性 | 斜杠命令(/) | At命令(@) | Shell命令(!) |\n|------|-----------|-----------|---------------|\n| **用途** | CLI 控制 | 文件注入 | 系统交互 |\n| **前缀** | `/` | `@` | `!` |\n| **命令数** | 25+ | 2 | 2种 |\n| **Git 过滤** | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ |\n| **交互** | 对话式 | 内容注入 | 执行命令 |\n| **常用场景** | 会话管理 | 代码分析 | 自动化 |"},
		{"id":"quick_ref","type":"text","x":50,"y":1760,"width":1100,"height":200,"text":"# 🚀 快速参考\n\n**会话:** `/chat save tag` → `/chat resume tag` → `/stats`\n**分析:** `@src/` 分析代码 → `/copy` 复制 → `/chat save`\n**编辑:** `/vim` → `i` 输入 → `Esc` → `dd` 删除 → `.` 重复\n**自动化:** `!npm run` → `!git push` → `!ls` 查看"}
	],
